sms-3ds builds against, and adapts code from, chasem-dev/sms-pc-port:

  - cmake/patches.cmake follows sms-pc-port's cmake/patches.cmake.
  - platform3ds/gx_null_backend.cpp and platform3ds/gx3ds/render.cpp copy
    primClass/primitiveIndices from sms-pc-port's platform/gx/src/gx_render.cpp,
    and follow its state decoding (applyGlState).
  - platform3ds/gx3ds/gx.v.pica and vtx.cpp follow the vertex shader generated
    by sms-pc-port's platform/gx/src/gx_shader.cpp (genVS, emitLight); tev.cpp
    and texture.cpp follow its register encodings and texture decoders.
  - patches/port/*.patch modify sms-pc-port files (applied at configure time to
    copies in the build directory; the originals are not redistributed here).

